    "summary": "US Oyster Digest An AI curated edition March 8, 2026 TL;DR Winter's toll, workforce's rise, and a West Coast wake-up call This week, the US oyster industry is reckoning with the aftermath of a brutal winter on the East Coast while simultaneously doubling down on workforce development and sustainability certification. Maryland oystermen are seeking federal disaster relief, New Jersey's shell recycling program is smash",
